< BusinessStart or hourofday(TimeGenerated) >= BusinessEnd or dayofweek(TimeGenerated) in (0d, 6d)\n| where Role in ({PIMRole}) or '*' in ({PIMRole});\nPIMActivations\n| project TimeGenerated, Requestor, Role, ResourceName, JustificationQuality, Justification, StartTime, EndTime, DurationHours, OutsideHours, Result\n| sort by TimeGenerated desc",
